  "releaseNotes": "* Renamed Windows based file permission extension methods for extra clarity\n* Reorganized Unix file permissions code into consolidated classes\n* Improved performance of Unix Permission Notation detection\n* Updated xml doc comments to use ``<see langword=true>`` and ``<see langword=false>`` instead of ``<c>true</c>`` or ``<c>false</c>``\n* Moved file size labels to Resources resx file\n* Moved Safe File Enumeration code and namespace\n* Added ``GetNonNullPathRoot(string)`` and ``GetNonNullPathRoot(string?)`` static extension methods to ``Path`` - These method guarantees they will not return a null value.",
